# --- shiroikuma fork ---
# Carries our signing password in plaintext — never commit it (keystore.properties_sample
# documents the keys and IS tracked).
/keystore.properties
# CLAUDE.md and .claude/skills/ stay COMMITTED; only the local settings override is ignored.
.claude/settings.local.json
.scratch/
# Room writes its schema export under a directory named after the database CLASS
# (MpvExDatabase). Upstream's committed copy is under the stale lower-case name
# "…database.mpvExDatabase", so every build here produces an untracked duplicate and leaves the
# tree dirty — which the upstream-new-version skill requires to be clean before rebasing. The
# generated files are identical in content to upstream's. Revisit if we ever change the schema.
/app/schemas/app.marlboroadvance.mpvex.database.MpvExDatabase/